son'))\nconf=d['configurations']\nfor c in ['indie-2d','mobile-3d']:\n  toks=set(conf[c])\n  base={'min2d','mobile3d','std3d'}\n  mem=[s['id'] for s in d['skills'] if 'all' in s['profiles'] or ('client' in s['profiles'] and 'server' not in toks) or toks & set(s['profiles'])]\n  print(c,len(mem),[m for m in mem if s and d['skills'][[x['id'] for x in d['skills']].index(m)]['runtime']])\n\"","description":"Check cycles and indie-2d runtime membership"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfXzdU549d7yYw1eZZRNQ","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a6e0eca9-48ef-4395-8f8e-0ccf459744c8","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:49:02.416Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
{"parentUuid":"a6e0eca9-48ef-4395-8f8e-0ccf459744c8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"ae46b4cd829201079","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n5:Skills never depend on each other's internals; they depend on **contracts**. A skill depends on another skill exactly when it consumes a contract that skill owns. Contracts carry a layer (0 platform → 5 tools, P = process) and a build-level `requires` list that `check.py` proves acyclic and never upward. Runtime data may flow in both directions between subsystems (animation ↔ physics), but only through frame phases declared in `C-FRAME`.\n24:  api_lifecycle_migration[\"API Lifecycle & Engine Migration\"]\n49:  api_lifecycle_migration --> core_runtime_architect\n50:  api_lifecycle_migration --> gameplay_architect\n51:  api_lifecycle_migration --> platform_architect\n52:  api_lifecycle_migration --> resource_streaming_architect\n67:  editor_architect --> api_lifecycle_migration\n137:| `C-PAL` Platform abstraction layer | 0 | platform-architect | — | 18 | OS services, CPU/GPU capability discovery, windowing, lifecycle events. No platform #ifdefs above this line. |\n138:| `C-PHYS` Physics world & scene queries | 3 | physics-architect | C-SPATIAL, C-ECS | 18 | Bodies, shapes, queries, contact events, stepping phases. |\n145:| `C-FRAME` Frame, tick phases & time | 2 | frame-orchestration | C-TASK | 10 | Phase list, sync points, time domains, fixed-step, pipelining depth. |\n177:| `C-MOD` Module & lifecycle | 1 | core-runtime-architect | C-PAL, C-ERR | 2 | Module descriptors, init dependency graph, service registration, shutdown order. |\n179:| `C-PLUGIN` Plugin descriptor & loading | 1 | plugin-system | C-MOD | 2 | Plugin manifest, dependency resolution, load phases, ABI tags. |\n184:| `C-SCRIPT` Script bindings | 4 | scripting-runtime | C-REFL, C-GAME | 1 | Binding generation, sandbox limits, script lifecycle. |\n186:| `C-API` API stability & deprecation | P | api-lifecycle-migration | — | universal (all) | Public vs internal APIs, versioning, deprecation windows, upgraders. |\n206:- `C-SER` (12 consumers) — Serialization & schema evolution: api-lifecycle-migration, collaboration-version-control, content-pipeline-architect, determinism-replay, editor-architect, graph-editor-framework, network-architect, package-formats-vfs, persistence-save, replication, robustness-fuzzing, world-data-model\n208:- `C-FRAME` (10 consumers) — Frame, tick phases & time: animation-architect, atmosphere-weather, dedicated-server, ecs-runtime, input-system, network-architect, physics-architect, reconstruction-upscaling, render-architect, xr-runtime\n213:## Runtime coupling cycles\n215:Required-edge cycles between skills. Each must be mediated by a frame phase or event contract, never by a direct call:\n244:| api-lifecycle-migration | C-API | C-SER, C-REFL | — | reflection-metadata, serialization-schema |\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<string>\", line 8, in <module>\n  File \"<string>\", line 8, in <listcomp>\nNameError: name 's' is not defined","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UjpFoB8TxfzgPPA9wBP14a"}]},"uuid":"e521fcfc-d65b-47bc-b440-1b3db90b3fe5","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:49:02.529Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Exit code 1\n5:Skills never depend on each other's internals; they depend on **contracts**. A skill depends on another skill exactly when it consumes a contract that skill owns. Contracts carry a layer (0 platform → 5 tools, P = process) and a build-level `requires` list that `check.py` proves acyclic and never upward. Runtime data may flow in both directions between subsystems (animation ↔ physics), but only through frame phases declared in `C-FRAME`.\n24:  api_lifecycle_migration[\"API Lifecycle & Engine Migration\"]\n49:  api_lifecycle_migration --> core_runtime_architect\n50:  api_lifecycle_migration --> gameplay_architect\n51:  api_lifecycle_migration --> platform_architect\n5