{"parentUuid":"96df3a20-779b-4542-b64e-907252ce07de","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"ae46b4cd829201079","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KRkWSDt2mEDudJMW26N1Ho","type":"tool_result","content":"K-ARCH ['all', 'tier:orchestrator', 'research-evidence', 'subtree:api-lifecycle-migration', 'subtree:world-architect', 'developer-experience-docs'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2']\n   ['every capability has exactly one owner and the owner is the right expertise', 'non-responsibilities point to the real owner', 'contracts are minimal, stable and layered', 'no hidden cyclic build dependencies', 'leads have real territory, not just coordination']\nK-RENDER ['subtree:render-architect', 'render-validation', 'gpu-performance', 'terrain', 'vegetation-foliage', 'water-ocean', 'atmosphere-weather', 'deformation-skinning', 'xr-runtime', 'ml-inference-runtime'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['no draw-call-centric or DX11-era assumptions', 'render graph owns sync and aliasing', 'technique maturity labels are honest', 'scale-down path exists for each feature']\nK-SYSTEMS ['subtree:core-runtime-architect', 'subtree:resource-streaming-architect', 'observability-telemetry', 'crash-diagnostics', 'determinism-replay', 'hot-reload-iteration', 'rhi-core', 'gpu-memory-resources', 'render-graph-scheduling', 'audio-architect', 'network-transport', 'ml-inference-runtime', 'subtree:world-architect'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3']\n   ['no single-thread-first assumptions', 'explicit ownership and lifetimes', 'synchronization minimized and justified', 'async IO end to end', 'heterogeneous cores and NUMA considered']\nK-SIM ['subtree:physics-architect', 'crowd-simulation', 'ik-procedural-animation', 'prediction-rollback', 'determinism-replay', 'procedural-generation', 'water-ocean', 'vfx-particles'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['stepping and sync with frame phases are explicit', 'determinism levels are declared', 'simulation LOD exists for large scales', 'build-vs-integrate evidence']\nK-NET ['subtree:network-architect', 'anti-cheat-integrity', 'platform-online-services', 'destruction-fracture', 'persistence-save', 'packaging-release-patching'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['netcode model matches game type', 'authority and trust explicit', 'bandwidth and scale budgets', 'version compatibility', 'service boundaries clear']\nK-TOOLS ['subtree:editor-architect', 'subtree:content-pipeline-architect', 'hot-reload-iteration', 'developer-experience-docs', 'ui-architect', 'terrain', 'procedural-generation', 'cinematics-sequencer', 'scripting-runtime', 'world-data-model', 'subtree:build-release-architect'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['tooling as thorough as runtime', 'undo/transactions universal', 'large teams can collaborate without lock contention', 'iteration time measured', 'pipeline deterministic and cached']\nK-PLATFORM ['subtree:platform-architect', 'rhi-core', 'subtree:build-release-architect', 'certification-compliance', 'async-io-storage', 'crash-diagnostics'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S4']\n   ['PAL is the only platform-specific layer', 'console, mobile and web constraints represented', 'certification requirements traced', 'packaging and patching per platform']\nK-PERF ['all', 'subtree:performance-architect', 'subtree:world-architect'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['budgets exist for each subsystem', 'benchmarks include realistic workloads', 'no hidden global sync points', 'asymptotics stated for world-scale data']\nK-PROD ['all', 'tier:orchestrator', 'developer-experience-docs', 'subtree:build-release-architect'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S4']\n   ['content creators are first-class', 'features have an owner through ship', 'live-ops and patching covered', 'scale-down keeps small teams productive']\nK-FUTURE ['all'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1']\n   ['extension points exist for emerging techniques', 'maturity labels allow promotion', \"no hard-coding of today's API limits\"]\nK-COMPLETE ['all'] ['G1', 'G2']\n   [\"compare against shipped engines' feature sets\", 'compare against platform requirements', 'compare against production pipelines end to end']\nK-LEGACY ['all'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S3']\n   ['each flagged pattern either absent or justified by an ADR']\nK-GAMEPLAY ['subtree:animation-architect', 'subtree:audio-architect', 'subtree:gameplay-architect', 'subtree:ui-architect', 'accessibility', 'input-system', 'input-devices-haptics', 'character-vehicle-physics'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S1', 'S2', 'S4']\n   ['designers and animators have authoring paths', 'accessibility and localization built in, not bolted on', 'gameplay extension points']\nK-QUALITY ['all', 'subtree:test-architect', 'subtree:security-engineering', 'subtree:api-lifecycle-migration'] ['G1', 'G2', 'S3', 'S4']\n   ['each skill has objective validation', 'untrusted inputs fuzzed', 'determinism and concurrency tested', 'security boundaries explicit']\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:106:### K-LEGACY · Anti-Legacy Critic\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:108:Find accidental legacy architecture: central sequential update loops, deep inheritance, global state, hot-path virtual dispatch, CPU-driven rendering, coarse locks, global renderer sync, frame-tied lifetimes, universal scene graphs, synchronous IO/loading, single-thread-first design, OpenGL/DX11 assumptions, monoliths. A flagged pattern needs justification, not removal.\ndocs/05-critic-framework.md:132:| Skill | ARCH | RENDER | SYSTEMS | SIM | NET | TOOLS | PLATFORM | PERF | PROD | FUTURE | COMPLETE | LEGACY | GAMEPLAY | QUALITY |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"129d3f90-6210-45d0-9d9b-be61507f7930","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:50:09.477Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"96df3a20-779b-4542-b64e-907252ce07de","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
